messages.text:
{#select n}{#case 1}The lamps are cold, and the first Dim are a rumour on the switchbacks.{#case 2}The second dusk. Ilse has oil on her sleeves and a question about the armoured ones.{#case 3}The third dusk. The east road is open, and the militia wants an answer.{#default}The last dusk. Every lamp in Marrow Hill is lit, and the Lantern is bright enough to read by.{/select}
{#if query bell_ruined()}The Bellfrey is a black shape against the sky; its bell is on the ground.{#else}Up in the Bellfrey the bell is being oiled for the night.{/if}
{#if query any_injured()}Somebody is missing from the lamp racks.{/if}
{#if query any_weak()}Corvin has walked the terraces and says a lamp or two will not last the night as things stand.{/if}
